      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1370312979,
      "text": "Cymbopogon giganteus is a species of perennial grass in the family of Poaceae native to tropical Africa and Madagascar. Its leaves, flowers, and roots were traditionally used in African folk medicine especially via essential oils and decoctions."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Citronnelle de brousse",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citronnelle_de_brousse",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 234567702,
      "text": "La Citronnelle de brousse, Cymbopogon caesius subsp. giganteus (Chiov.) Sales, est une espèce de plantes herbacées de la famille des poacées originaire d'Afrique."
    }
  },
